Open CASCADE Technology @PAACS_OCCT_VERSION@

This wheel uses shared Open CASCADE Technology libraries. OCCT is licensed under
GNU LGPL version 2.1 with the Open CASCADE exception. Both texts are included in
the adjacent licenses directory. PAACS Mesh is separately licensed under MPL-2.0.

The unmodified OCCT source used by the wheel source-build recipe is available at:
@PAACS_OCCT_URL@
SHA-512: @PAACS_OCCT_SHA512@

The wheel build script provides the verified source archive beside the wheel.
Keep this archive available with any redistributed wheel. The PAACS source
contains the matching build recipe in cmake/step and cmake/python. OCCT shared
libraries are bundled separately from the PAACS extension. DLL filenames may be
isolated by the wheel repair tool; the OCCT source is unchanged.

To replace OCCT, use the provided source recipe to build a compatible shared SDK,
then rebuild the wheel with scripts/build_python_wheel.py --occt-dir pointing to
that SDK's CMake configuration directory. The supported public wheels use the
pinned OCCT version above. Do not replace only one DLL in an incompatible set.

Windows wheels may include unmodified Microsoft Visual C++ runtime files from
the licensed Visual Studio redistributable directory. These files are separately
licensed by Microsoft, not under MPL or LGPL. Their redistribution terms are at:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/visualstudio/releases/2022/redistribution
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/cpp/windows/redistributing-visual-cpp-files
